@startuml
title Market Desk - local shopper use cases after J12

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Local shopper\n(one user, one device)" as Shopper

rectangle "Market Desk (local web app)" {
  usecase "Ask a checked price\nquestion (J09)" as UCAsk
  usecase "Choose a product when\nthe question is unclear" as UCClarify
  usecase "Export a chosen list\nas a separate copy (J10)" as UCExport
  usecase "Import a shared list" as UCImport
  usecase "Reopen a saved list\noffline (J11)" as UCOffline
  usecase "Switch UI language\n(en / zh_TW / zh_CN)" as UCLang
  usecase "Turn on high-contrast\ndisplay" as UCContrast
  usecase "View, export and delete\nlocal personal data" as UCPersonal
  usecase "View dated price history\nwith gaps and empty state" as UCHistory
}

actor "Consumer Council\nprice feed" as Feed
actor "DeepSeek V4 Flash\n(server-side key)" as AI

Shopper --> UCAsk
Shopper --> UCClarify
Shopper --> UCExport
Shopper --> UCImport
Shopper --> UCOffline
Shopper --> UCLang
Shopper --> UCContrast
Shopper --> UCPersonal
Shopper --> UCHistory

UCAsk ..> UCClarify : <<extend>>\nunclear product
UCAsk --> AI : explains checked facts\n(optional, never invents)
UCExport ..> UCImport : file hand-off
UCImport --> Feed : product labels only
UCPersonal ..> UCExport : list sharing is\nnarrower than personal data

note right of UCOffline
  The copy is one self-contained HTML file;
  no live price or chat is claimed.
end note

note bottom of UCHistory
  Only stored observations are shown.
  Missing days appear as an explicit gap.
end note
@enduml
